IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `roc-core`
IMPORT `roc8-nouns`
IMPORT `roc8-order-38`

-- Rules of Court 2021 (Singapore), Order 38: TESTS.  Every expected value is written from the text of the paragraph
-- named beside it, before running.  The "last day" and "first day" are made-up dates standing in for O 3 r 3's count (S-T1, S-T1b).
-- The record tests are generated by work/mk38t.py.

`o 38 test d1` MEANS Date 1 3 2026
`o 38 test d10` MEANS Date 10 3 2026
`o 38 test d15` MEANS Date 15 3 2026
`o 38 test d16` MEANS Date 16 3 2026
`o 38 test d20` MEANS Date 20 3 2026


GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `o 38 r 3(1) entitling of a document`
`o 38 test 3-1` MEANS `o 38 r 3(1) entitling of a document` WITH
    `o 38 r 3(1) it is entitled in the matter of the company in question` IS a
    `o 38 r 3(1) it is entitled in the matter of the Act` IS b

