§§ `o 38 r 3(1) the document is entitled as the paragraph requires (generated)`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

#ASSERT `o 38 r 3(1) the document is entitled as the paragraph requires` (`o 38 test 3-1` TRUE TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 38 r 3(1) the document is entitled as the paragraph requires` (`o 38 test 3-1` FALSE TRUE) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
