GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A BOOLEAN, c IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A BOOLEAN, e IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `o 38 r 5(1) affidavit and list of qualifying creditors`
`o 38 test 5-1` MEANS `o 38 r 5(1) affidavit and list of qualifying creditors` WITH
    `o 38 r 5(1) the affidavit is made by an officer of the company competent to make it` IS a
    `o 38 r 5(1) the affidavit verifies a list` IS b
    `o 38 r 5(1)(a) the list contains the name and address of every qualifying creditor` IS c
    `o 38 r 5(1)(b) the list contains the amount due to each qualifying creditor or, for a claim subject to a contingency, sounding only in damages or not bearing a certain value, a just estimate of its value` IS d
    `o 38 r 5(1)(c) the list contains the total of those amounts and values` IS e

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
