GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `o 38 r 5(2) statements in the affidavit`
`o 38 test 5-2` MEANS `o 38 r 5(2) statements in the affidavit` WITH
    `o 38 r 5(2) the deponent states the deponent's belief that, at the date fixed by the Court, there is no debt owed to, or claim of, any qualifying creditor which is not set out in the list` IS a
    `o 38 r 5(2) the deponent states the deponent's means of knowledge of the matters deposed to` IS b

