GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A BOOLEAN, c IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A BOOLEAN, e IS A BOOLEAN, f IS A BOOLEAN, g IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `o 38 r 7 notice to a qualifying creditor`
`o 38 test 7` MEANS `o 38 r 7 notice to a qualifying creditor` WITH
    `o 38 r 7 it is sent by post` IS a
    `o 38 r 7 it is sent to each qualifying creditor named in the list exhibited to the affidavit` IS b
    `o 38 r 7 it is sent at the qualifying creditor's last known address` IS c
    `o 38 r 7(a) it states the amount of the reduction sought to be confirmed` IS d
    `o 38 r 7(b) it states the effect of the order as to the proceedings to be taken for settling the list` IS e
    `o 38 r 7(c) it states the amount or value specified in the list as due or estimated to be due to that qualifying creditor` IS f
    `o 38 r 7(d) it states the time fixed by the Court within which, if the qualifying creditor claims a larger amount, the creditor must send particulars and the name and address of the creditor's solicitor (if any) to the company's solicitor` IS g

