GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A BOOLEAN, c IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A BOOLEAN, e IS A BOOLEAN, f IS A BOOLEAN, g IS A BOOLEAN, h IS A BOOLEAN, i IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `o 38 r 11 Registrar's certificate`
`o 38 test 11` MEANS `o 38 r 11 Registrar's certificate` WITH
    `o 38 r 11 the list is certified and filed by the Registrar` IS a
    `o 38 r 11(a) the certificate specifies the debts or claims (if any) disallowed by the Court` IS b
    `o 38 r 11(b)(i) the certificate distinguishes the debts or claims the full amount of which is admitted by the company` IS c
    `o 38 r 11(b)(ii) the certificate distinguishes the debts or claims the full amount of which, though not admitted by the company, the company is willing to secure` IS d
    `o 38 r 11(b)(iii) the certificate distinguishes the debts or claims the amount of which has been fixed by adjudication of the Court under section 78H(4)` IS e
    `o 38 r 11(b)(iv) the certificate distinguishes other debts or claims` IS f
    `o 38 r 11(c) the certificate specifies the total amount of the debts or claims which have been secured for the purposes of section 78I(2)` IS g
    `o 38 r 11(d) the certificate shows which qualifying creditors consent to the reduction and the total amount of their debts or claims` IS h
    `o 38 r 11(e) the certificate specifies the persons who sought to prove their debts or claims under Rule 10 and states which of such debts or claims were allowed` IS i

