GIVETH AN `o 38 r 14(2) affidavit`
`o 38 test 14-2` MEANS `o 38 r 14(2) affidavit` WITH
    `o 38 r 14(2)(a) it states the name and registration number of the corporation in question` IS a
    `o 38 r 14(2)(b) it states the nature of the business or intended business of the corporation` IS b
    `o 38 r 14(2)(c) it states the place or places where the business of the corporation is to be carried on` IS c
    `o 38 r 14(2)(d) it states whether the corporation is to be incorporated as a private or public company` IS d
    `o 38 r 14(2)(e) it states the persons who are, or are to be, principally responsible for conducting the affairs of the corporation` IS e
    `o 38 r 14(2)(f) it states the manner and capacity in which the bankrupt proposes to take part in or be concerned in the management of the corporation` IS f
    `o 38 r 14(2)(g) it states the emoluments or other benefits to be obtained by the bankrupt` IS g

